{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19102","headline":"览董评事思归之什因以诗赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"览董评事思归之什因以诗赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年油幕佐征东，却泛沧浪狎钓童。\n欹枕醉眠成戏蝶，抱琴闲望送归鸿。\n文儒自袭胶西相，倚伏能齐塞上翁。\n更说扁舟动乡思，青菰已熟奈秋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}